body
  .page-home
    section
      h1.page-title DevTips<br>Starter Kit v3 
      p Ground zero for your next project. eine update von dev-tips Starter Kit. 
      a.button.button-download(href="https://github.com/ghuj/DevTips-Starter-Kit-V3/archive/refs/heads/main.zip") Download Now
      a.fork-tag(href="https://github.com/ghuj/DevTips-Starter-Kit-V3.git") Fork Me on GitHub
    section
      article
        h4 Update from Travis Neilson Devtips Starter Kit
        p A simple Gulp 4 Starter Kit for modern web development.
        p Devtips Starter Kit is a powerful front-end template for the development of fast, robust and flexible web applications or websites.
        h4 A full list of all updates for all instances.
        .list-container   
          ul.inside
            li npm - update
            li node - update
            li npx - update
            li gulp - 4.0.2
            li devDependencies:
            li browser-sync: 3.0.4 → 2.29.3
            li del: 8.0.1 → 6.1.1
            li gulp-sass: 6.0.1 → 5.1.0
            li sass: 1.97.1 → 1.69.5
            li package.json
